      <div type="clause" n="3.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 3.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ælc tihtbysig man gange to þryfeldan órdale oððe gilde feowergilde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every man of bad repute shall go to the triple ordeal or pay fourfold [the value of the goods involved].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et omnis infamatus homo uadat ad triplex ordalium uel reddat quadruplum.</ab>
      </div>
